    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεπ-αίρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raise besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφάλιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.102
				</span></i>
			:—metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be encouraged yet more</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεπήρθη ὑπὸ τῆς ξυμμαχίας δέξασθαι
					τοὺς Μακεδόνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.5.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				48.21
			</span></i>.</div>
